		(descr "0201 (0603 metric, 0.6 x 0.3 mm) GRM033/GRM0335 MLCC. IPC-7351C least density (D109): lands 0.26 x 0.28 at +-0.24 (pitch 0.48, gap 0.22, overall 0.74 x 0.28). Chip 0.60+-0.03 x 0.30+-0.03 (Murata GRM03 / LQP03 / BLM03, Yageo RC0201, Ralec RTT01): toe 0.07 past the nominal end, 0.055 at L max 0.63; land inner edge 0.11 (terminal inner edge >= 0.10 at the longest terminal e 0.20 / I2 0.20, heel -0.01); width 0.28 vs W 0.30 (side -0.01). Inside every Murata GR*03 Table 2 reflow range (a 0.20-0.30 -> 0.22, b 0.20-0.35 -> 0.26, c 0.20-0.40 -> 0.28). A 0.25 mm HDI microvia land (0.10 laser) fits inside each land (D107). Courtyard max(body, land) + 0.10 = 0.94 x 0.50. Derived from lib:C_0201_0603Metric_W (same frame, pad numbers, 3D model, F.Fab body, no component silk); spec hardware/tools/land_specs/C_0201_0603Metric_L.json")
