		(descr "XINGLIGHT XL-1010RGBC-WS2812B. Land per ${OPENDRONE_LIB}/datasheet/XL-1010RGBC-WS2812B.pdf p11 'Outline Dimension' (1.0 x 1.0, top view 1 DOUT top-left, 2 VDD top-right, 3 GND bottom-left, 4 DI bottom-right) and 'Recommended Soldering Pattern' (0.45 pads, 0.4 gaps). recommended pattern with the outer edges trimmed 0.10 (inner gap 0.40 kept). DENSE: budget envelope WS1010 1.1 x 1.1 vs recommended 1.3 x 1.3: pads 0.35 at +-0.375 (outer edge 0.55, 0.05 past the body); the corner terminals (0.35 gaps, p11 bottom view) stay covered within 0.025 at the inner edge. Corrected copy of OpenDrone:LED-SMD_4P-L1.0-W1.0-TL_XL-1010RGBC-WS2812B (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/LED-SMD_4P-L1.0-W1.0-TL_XL-1010RGBC-WS2812B_Dense.json")
